				<element type="warning_sequence">2</element>
                <text type="warning_situation">
				<p>MINOR FLOODING OCCURRING AT OAKBANK AND LIKELY AT WOODSIDE FROM LATE MONDAY EVENING </p>

				<p/>
				<p>Moderate to locally heavy rainfall has been observed across the Onkaparinga catchment since Monday afternoon. Further rainfall is forecast during the remainder of Monday and into Tuesday. This has caused river and creek level rises, and minor flooding is occurring along the Onkaparinga River at Oakbank. Minor flooding is  likely at Woodside from late Monday evening.</p>

				<p/>

                </text>
                <element type="severity">Minor</element>
